# Content negotiation rules for https://w3id.org/tamu/dc-types/
#
# This file is NOT served by this repo. It is submitted (as .htaccess) to the
# w3id.org permanent-identifier service, in a pull request against
# https://github.com/perma-id/w3id.org adding it at path:
#   tamu/dc-types/.htaccess
#
# w3id.org runs Apache, so it can inspect the client's Accept header and
# 303-redirect to the right representation on GitHub Pages. GitHub Pages
# itself is static and cannot do this, which is why w3id.org sits in front
# of it as the canonical namespace (https://w3id.org/tamu/dc-types/...).
#
# Every concept in the vocabulary lives at a URI under this namespace, e.g.
#   https://w3id.org/tamu/dc-types/ImageADO
# Since all concepts are described within the single vocabulary file, any
# path under this namespace resolves to the same Turtle/RDF-XML file, or to
# the matching #fragment on the HTML page.

RewriteEngine On
RewriteBase /tamu/dc-types/

# --- RDF/XML ---
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml [NC]
RewriteRule ^$ https://tamulib-dc-labs.github.io/tamu-dc-ontology/tamu-dc-types.rdf [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} application/rdf\+xml [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.+)$ https://tamulib-dc-labs.github.io/tamu-dc-ontology/tamu-dc-types.rdf [R=303,L]

# --- Turtle ---
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle [NC]
RewriteRule ^$ https://tamulib-dc-labs.github.io/tamu-dc-ontology/tamu-dc-types.ttl [R=303,L]
RewriteCond %{HTTP_ACCEPT} text/turtle [NC]
RewriteRule ^(.+)$ https://tamulib-dc-labs.github.io/tamu-dc-ontology/tamu-dc-types.ttl [R=303,L]

# --- default: human-readable HTML (optionally deep-linked to the concept) ---
RewriteRule ^$ https://tamulib-dc-labs.github.io/tamu-dc-ontology/ [R=303,L]
RewriteRule ^(.+)$ https://tamulib-dc-labs.github.io/tamu-dc-ontology/#$1 [R=303,L]
